{"page":{"id":"79c63bde-fe6b-45fe-9058-c22dc570aa5d","theme":"the-legend-of-zelda","slug":"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon","title":"Ganon","meta_title":"Ganon (The Legend of Zelda) — person, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Ganon is the monstrous Demon King form associated with the Triforce of Power, repeatedly threatening Hyrule. Related pages: Ganondorf, Link, Princess Zelda,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Beast form of the Demon King.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/gerudo-desert/ganondorf\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Ganondorf</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Link</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Princess Zelda</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Triforce</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Hyrule</strong></a> and <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/master-sword\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Master Sword</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Ganon connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/gerudo-desert/ganondorf\" class=\"entity-link\">Ganondorf</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/gerudo-desert/ganondorf\" class=\"entity-link\">Ganondorf</a> becomes Ganon.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Opposed By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a> opposes Ganon across eras.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">Princess Zelda</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">Princess Zelda</a> is connected to Ganon through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a>\n            — Ganon is connected to <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a>\n            — Ganon is connected to <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/master-sword\" class=\"entity-link\">Master Sword</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/master-sword\" class=\"entity-link\">Master Sword</a> is connected to Ganon through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/a-link-to-the-past\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/a-link-to-the-past\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past</a> is connected to Ganon through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/breath-of-the-wild\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/breath-of-the-wild\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</a> is connected to Ganon through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">7</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/gerudo-desert/ganondorf\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Ganondorf</strong>\n                    <span>Gerudo king who becomes Ganon.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Princess Zelda</strong>\n                    <span>Princess of Hyrule and bearer of Wisdom.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Triforce</strong>\n                    <span>Golden relic of Power, Wisdom, and Courage.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/gerudo-desert/ganondorf\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Ganondorf\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Ganondorf becomes Ganon.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Princess Zelda\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Princess Zelda is connected to Ganon through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Triforce\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Ganon is connected to Triforce through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Hyrule\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Ganon is connected to Hyrule through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n            